style='font-weight:bold'>暖气风口轻轻响着。侯天一盯着前方，奥德赛拐进老城区，车速跟着慢下来。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{79}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Microsoft YaHei';font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold'>巷子口霓虹少了，路灯把雪照得发灰。地面结着一层薄冰，轮胎碾上去，发出细碎的脆响。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{81}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>“</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>车可以看。</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>”</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>侯天一开口时，厂子的铁门已经出现在路灯下面，</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>“</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>打火不行。那车后驱，离合还沉，你本儿新，雪天一给油就得学刚才那台</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>86</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>。</span><span
