style='font-weight:bold'>小智嘴张了张，到嘴边的话又咽了回去。他摸出一根白将军，指头还黏，烟纸粘在指腹上，只好别回口袋。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{85}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Microsoft YaHei';font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold'>奥德赛在铁门前停稳，发动机声音落下去。侯天一拉上手刹，解开了安全带。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{87}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Microsoft YaHei';font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold'>铁门关得死死的，门缝里往外钻风。灰布被雪压塌一角，露出半截掉了漆的保险杠，旁边还有一枚蒙着灰的圆灯。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{89}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Microsoft YaHei';font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold'>小智捏着杯子下车，人往门缝凑，冷风灌进领口，他打了个哆嗦，眼睛盯住那枚圆灯。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{91}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>侯天一锁好车，走到他侧边，抬手把人拨回巷子中间。</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>“</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>灯罩上全是灰，牌子看不清。明天除夕，先回家吃饭。</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>”</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{93}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>“</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>吃完我去拿那台的钥匙，布可以掀，打火的事别想。</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>”</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>侯天一说完，把奥德赛的钥匙在指间转了一圈。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{95}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>“</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>行行行，我今晚就用眼睛看，手指头不碰车。</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>”</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>小智笑出了声，空杯子被他捏得咔咔响，裤腿上的咖啡渍已经发暗。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{97}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Microsoft YaHei';font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold'>一阵风顺着门缝灌出来，灰布掀起一寸。圆灯边上露出半块缺了角的车标，雪粒落上去，很快化成水。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{99}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>侯天一转身往家里的灯光走，开口喊他。</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>“</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei"'>跟上。我想喝口热的，咖啡这玩意儿今晚够了。</span><span
style='font-weight:bold;font-family:"Fira Code"'>”</span>]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE authorResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" lastModifiedByResolutionID="&lt;resolutionId provider=&quot;Windows Live&quot; hash=&quot;7VBB3R4Oxezz4dDLg1XDkQ==&quot;&gt;&lt;localId cid=&quot;a21b323b213f5cb7&quot;/&gt;&lt;/resolutionId&gt;" creationTime="2026-09-21T17:40:17.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-21T17:42:23.000Z" objectID="{376E23FE-DFBE-489E-866A-3AED95EFB0B0}{101}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:'Microsoft YaHei';font-size:16.0pt;color:black"><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-weight:bold'>小智又盯着那块缺角的车标看了两秒，到底没问出口，小跑着跟上去。薄冰在脚下碎开，巷子里留下一串湿脚印。</span>]]></one:T></one:OE></one:OEChildren></one:Outline>
